<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-paperwork.webp 1023w" sizes="100vw" width="1023" height="681" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/claim-worksheets/">Worksheets</a></li><li aria-current="page">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free estimator</p><h1>Claim Gap &amp; Appraisal Fee Estimator</h1><p class="lede">Compare the carrier’s estimate with yours, choose where an award might land, and see what’s left after your appraiser and half an umpire are paid. Figures are illustrative.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool" data-tool="gap">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Claim gap &amp; fee estimator</span><i>Runs in your browser</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="g-ins">Carrier’s estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-ins" name="insurer" inputmode="decimal" value="22600"><span class="hint">Replacement cost total on the insurer’s estimate.</span></div>
        <div><label for="g-own">Your estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-own" name="yours" inputmode="decimal" value="38900"><span class="hint">Your contractor’s or independent estimate.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div><label for="g-land">Where might the award land inside the gap?</label>
        <div class="range"><input id="g-land" type="range" name="land" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="55" data-unit="%"><output>55%</output></div>
        <span class="hint">0% means the carrier’s figure holds; 100% means your full figure is awarded. Panels often land in between.</span></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="g-ft">Your appraiser’s fee basis</label><select id="g-ft" name="feetype"><option value="flat">Flat fee ($)</option><option value="pct">Percent of the increase (%)</option></select></div>
        <div><label for="g-fee">Fee amount</label><input id="g-fee" name="fee" inputmode="decimal" value="2800"></div>
      </div>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="useump" checked> Include my half of an umpire’s fee</label>
      <div><label for="g-ump">Umpire’s total fee (split 50/50)</label><input id="g-ump" name="umpire" inputmode="decimal" value="3200"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="out-big"><small>Estimated net increase to you</small><b data-o="net">$0</b></div>
      <div class="stack" aria-hidden="true"><span class="s-a"></span><span class="s-b"></span><span class="s-c"></span></div>
      <div class="legend"><span><i class="s-a"></i>Carrier’s figure</span><span><i class="s-b"></i>Your net gain</span><span><i class="s-c"></i>Appraisal costs</span></div>
      <div class="out-rows">
        <div><span>Amount in dispute</span><b data-o="gap">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Gap as % of carrier estimate</span><b data-o="pct">—</b></div>
        <div><span>Projected award (RCV)</span><b data-o="award">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Gross increase</span><b data-o="gain">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Your appraisal costs</span><b data-o="cost">$0</b></div>
      </div>
      <p class="out-msg" data-o="msg"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>
<p class="tool-note">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice, and nothing you enter is stored.</p></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>How the estimator works</h2>
<p>The disputed amount is simply your estimate minus the carrier’s. Appraisal panels rarely award either side’s full number, so the slider lets you test outcomes anywhere in between. The tool then subtracts your appraiser’s fee (flat or percentage) and, if you tick the box, half of the umpire’s fee.</p>
<h2>Reading the result</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Net increase:</strong> the projected award minus the carrier’s estimate, minus your costs.</li>
<li><strong>Gap as a percentage:</strong> a quick sense of how far apart the two estimates are.</li>
<li><strong>The message:</strong> a rule-of-thumb read on whether appraisal, a supplement or a review is the logical next step.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Keep in mind</h2>
<p>These figures are illustrative only. Real awards depend on the evidence, the panel and your policy. Deductibles, depreciation and prior payments also affect what you actually receive — try the <a href="/claim-worksheets/depreciation-holdback-worksheet/">RCV/ACV holdback calculator</a> for that part.</p>
<h2>Questions about this worksheet</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Where should I set the slider?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Try several positions. A well-documented claim may land closer to your number; a weak one closer to the carrier’s. The point is to see whether appraisal still makes sense at a cautious setting.</p></div></details><details><summary>Are appraiser fees really that much?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Fees vary by claim size and complexity. Enter the actual quote you receive; any appraiser should give you the fee in writing before work starts.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does the estimator account for my deductible?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. It compares estimate totals. Use the holdback calculator to see how deductibles and depreciation affect payment.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free worksheets</h2><div class="cards cards-3"><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-worksheets/depreciation-holdback-worksheet/"><span class="card-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-body"><h3 class="card-t">RCV / ACV Holdback Calculator</h3><span class="card-p">Work out depreciation line by line, your first payment and the holdback you can recover after repairs.</span><span class="card-more">Open worksheet <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-worksheets/roof-pitch-and-squares-calculator/"><span class="card-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="802" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-body"><h3 class="card-t">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</h3><span class="card-p">Convert a footprint and pitch into roof squares, waste, bundles and a rough replacement cost.</span><span class="card-more">Open worksheet <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-worksheets/named-storm-deductible-worksheet/"><span class="card-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds-shore.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds-shore-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-clouds-shore.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-body"><h3 class="card-t">Hurricane Deductible Calculator</h3><span clas